<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">Notes to Condensed Consolidated Financial Statements (Unaudited)<a id="Notes_to_Condensed_Consolidated_Financial_Statements" href="#"></a></p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<div>&#160;</div>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30" name="us-gaap:OrganizationConsolidationAndPresentationOfFinancialStatementsDisclosureTextBlock" id="c281" escape="true">
